                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The deductible and co-payment do not apply to the deductible or out-of-pocket maximums of the Comprehensive Medical Plan. The out-of-pocket maximum for PIC is $300 per person.",
